000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">게시판 - FAQ - 학점인정 - 군복무학점인정 시행 안내</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 참고) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 인정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학점 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">군OCU 또는 군교육훈련 중 택일하여 1학기당 3학점, 연 6학점 이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 인정학기 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014학년도 1학기(군 제대 후 복학 학기)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 이수구분 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">군OCU : ‘교양선택’으로 인정 / 군교육훈련 : ‘일반선택’으로 인정</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGH